# Run outputs (briefs, PRFAQs, PRDs, research) land here.
# Per ICM discipline, generated artifacts are not committed.
#
# Exception: the epics & stories deliverable (epics.md) + its
# implementation-readiness report are tracked so they can be reviewed via PR.
# Inputs (briefs/PRD/architecture/council logs) remain local-only.
*
!.gitkeep
!.gitignore
!05-epics-and-stories/
!05-epics-and-stories/**
